<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="content-page">
  <section class="content-hero">
    <p class="content-eyebrow">Code of Conduct</p>
    <h1>Respect the platform, the partners, and the people behind every order.</h1>
    <p class="content-lead">
      This page explains the behavior we expect from users, partners, and team members so the experience stays safe and fair.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="policy-list">
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Be respectful</h2>
      <p>No abusive language, harassment, discrimination, threats, or fraudulent activity.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Use the service honestly</h2>
      <p>Do not place fake orders, manipulate ratings, or misuse promotional offers.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Protect account integrity</h2>
      <p>Keep login credentials private and report suspicious account behavior quickly.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Respect deliveries</h2>
      <p>Provide accurate addresses and stay reachable when your order is on the way.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
